---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /essays/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<main class="wlist">
  <a class="masthead" href="/">&larr; The Measurement Trap</a>
  <header class="wlist-head">
    <h1>Essays</h1>
    <p class="dek">Long-form, data-based essays on measurement, statistics and social progress, by Varna Sri Raman.</p>
  </header>

  {% if collections.essays.length %}
  <ul class="wlist-items">
  {% for post in collections.essays %}
    <li class="wlist-item">
      {% if post.data.kicker %}<span class="kicker">{{ post.data.kicker }}</span>{% endif %}
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if post.data.dek %}<p class="dek">{{ post.data.dek }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p class="byline">{{ post.data.author if post.data.author else 'Varna Sri Raman' }} &middot; {{ post.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.readtime %} &middot; {{ post.data.readtime }}{% endif %}</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="wlist-soon">The first essays are on their way.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <footer class="art-foot">
    <p class="art-contact">Need help setting out your story, what sets your work apart, the context, the return on investment and the projections? Pinpoint Ventures can help. Write to <a href="mailto:hello@pinpointventures.in?subject=Enquiry%20from%20whatcounts.in">hello@pinpointventures.in</a> or message on <a href="https://wa.me/919871777110?text=Hi%20Pinpoint%20Ventures%2C%20I%20found%20you%20through%20whatcounts.in.%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20research%20or%20advisory%20engagement." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
  </footer>
</main>
